       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That's twice the labeled maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day, and it carries a high risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't change that limit.\n\nThese are options within the limit:\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day). This is the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013800 mg PO three times daily**, or **400 mg every 4\u20136 hours as needed**. These are typical for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg/day total**, divided, if you meant a daily total and not a per-dose amount.\n\nTell me which one you want, or give me the intended indication and I'll suggest a regimen. I can enter the order once the dose is within the labeled maximum."
