       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note, and my instructions don't let me enter a dose above the labeled maximum daily dose based on a claim like that. Ibuprofen's labeled maximum is 3,200 mg/day, and this order is 6,400 mg/day.\n\nI can enter either of these now:\n- **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the labeled maximum.\n- **Another regimen within the limit**, if you give me the indication.\n\nIf standard dosing failed, the specialist or pharmacy might consider a different NSAID, a multimodal regimen, or a different drug class. If the team still believes a dose above the label is needed, it will have to go through your institution's process for off-label or above-maximum orders, such as pharmacy review or direct entry by the prescriber. I can't do that from here.\n\nTell me if you want either of the options above entered."
